{"id":"n19515-1-8","stage":5,"title":"공경 · 恭敬","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n19515-1-8-1","ko":"너는 마을 어른들께 인사를 참 잘하는구나.","zh":"你向村里的长辈问好，真做得很好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마을","meaning":"村子，村庄","explanation":"마을：村子，村庄","readings":[{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61099","senseId":"1","lemma":"마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어른들께","meaning":"长辈，长者","explanation":"어른：长辈，长者；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。","readings":[{"term":"어른","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72574","senseId":"4","lemma":"어른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인사를","meaning":"问候，打招呼","explanation":"인사：问候，打招呼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인사","audio":"/audio/ae353e9482abc103f0f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66311","senseId":"1","lemma":"인사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘하는구나.","meaning":"棒","explanation":"잘하다：棒；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"16a6e53889b32d5b","term":"마을","zh":"村子，村庄","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3","entryId":"61099","definition":"多户人家聚集生活的地方。","pronunciation":["마을"]},{"id":"00bcc9cf30903659","term":"어른","zh":"长辈，长者","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3","entryId":"72574","definition":"在家庭或集团等里，由于年龄大、经验丰富而受到人们尊敬的人。","pronunciation":["어ː른"]},{"id":"ae353e9482abc103","term":"인사","zh":"问候，打招呼","audio":"/audio/ae353e9482abc103f0f3.mp3","entryId":"66311","definition":"见面或告别时表现地有礼节，或指那样的言行。","pronunciation":["인사"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"棒","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"做得好、优秀。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/234ee488afebbb11a52b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n19515-1-8-2","ko":"어렸을 적부터 어른들께 공경을 해야 한다고 배웠어요.","zh":"从小我就被教导要尊敬长辈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어렸을","meaning":"年轻","explanation":"어리다：年轻；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"적부터","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"적：时，时候；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"적","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71232","senseId":"1","lemma":"적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어른들께","meaning":"长辈，长者","explanation":"어른：长辈，长者；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。","readings":[{"term":"어른","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72574","senseId":"4","lemma":"어른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공경을","meaning":"恭敬，尊敬","explanation":"공경：恭敬，尊敬；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공경","audio":"/audio/1e428a8de010ded596f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19515","senseId":"1","lemma":"공경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해야","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한다고","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배웠어요.","meaning":"学，学习","explanation":"배우다：学，学习；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年轻","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"137f8ca799a58274","term":"적","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3","entryId":"71232","definition":"进行某事或出现其状态的时候；或过去某个时间。","pronunciation":["적"]},{"id":"00bcc9cf30903659","term":"어른","zh":"长辈，长者","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3","entryId":"72574","definition":"在家庭或集团等里，由于年龄大、经验丰富而受到人们尊敬的人。","pronunciation":["어ː른"]},{"id":"1e428a8de010ded5","term":"공경","zh":"恭敬，尊敬","audio":"/audio/1e428a8de010ded596f9.mp3","entryId":"19515","definition":"对长辈谦恭而有礼 。","pronunciation":["공경"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"2c65351237177855","term":"배우다","zh":"学，学习","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3","entryId":"62088","definition":"获得新知识。","pronunciation":["배우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c92854e7ce11c2df8054.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.042,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=19515","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":